DESCRIPTION:Halloween Trick or Treat Ride This is a sponsored ride \, whic
 h means we’ll make several stops at TBN sponsors and partners along the 
 route. At each stop\, there may be a little treat\, a quick introduction t
 o a business\, or something fun to share before we hop back on the bikes. 
 Expect an easy-paced ride of approximately 40 km on mostly bike lanes and 
 residential streets and parts of the waterfront trail with multiple treat 
 stops along the way. It will be a fun city-focused ride that everyone can 
 enjoy. We’ll wrap up with more treats and some social time at the finish
  at the Distillery **you will have to make your own way home from there. C
 ostumes are encouraged but completely optional. There...
