BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Bicycling Network": "https://www.tbn.ca/widget/event-6847699"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_bicycling_network
SUMMARY:Saturday Morning Ride: from Victoria Park/Danforth. New route. FIN
 AL RIDE of 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261031T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261031T123000
UID:e12e6eb2791a935a46a80bd5729c9e5b@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:Created in 2026\, this ride starts from the Shoppers World pla
 za (Danforth and Victoria Park) and goes north\, picks up part of the new 
 North Don trail. Then south on the ( recently revived ) Don Trail to the L
 akeshore. A coffee break at Leslie/Lakeshore will note this as our last Sa
 turday Morning Ride of the 2026 season!! Then back to Victoria Park by mos
 tly quiet streets. About 31kms- should finish about 12:30 to 1pm. This is 
 an Urban Roller level ride. If you are uncertain whether this level is app
 ropriate to your riding level\, click here . RWGPS link to route: Click he
