DESCRIPTION:Address:\nEvergreen Brick Works\nMeet outside the main Evergre
 en Brick Works entrance (pictured on the flyer).\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\n
 Join the Rotaract Club of Toronto for our Fall Social! 🍂🥾 We’re ta
 king a hike through the trails around Evergreen Brick Works to enjoy the f
 all colours\, fresh air and great company.\nEveryone is welcomed! members\
 , friends and anyone curious about Rotaract!\n📅 Sunday\, November 1 at 
 2:00 PM\n📍 Meeting point: outside the main Evergreen Brick Works entran
 ce.\nClocks go back that morning! Remember to set your clocks back 1 hour 
 so you’re not an hour early.\nBring water\, wear comfy walking shoes and
  dress for the weather.\n\nHosted by Rotaract Toronto
