SUMMARY:Vigil for the Martyrs - by Scarborough Loves Palestine
LOCATION:Scarborough Town Centre (Outside TTC Entrance)
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DfBVeL2RJ20\n\nHosted by
  Scarborough Loves Palestine
  (https://www.instagram.com/scarboroughlovespalestine/)\n\nThere is
  something terribly cruel about a world that asks the dead to prove they
  deserved to live. Gather for the martyrs of Gaza\, not to turn their
  deaths into another spectacle of suffering but o remember their names\,
  to carry their stories and to honour them.
END:VEVENT
