SUMMARY:Lunch and Learn: U of T Engineering Graduate Studies Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an information session that explores U of T engineering graduate studies options and what they have to offer. This session\, hosted by the Vice-Dean Graduate Studies Office\, covers: a general overview of graduate programs\, the differences between the Master of Engineering (MEng) program and research-based programs (MASc/PhD)\, details about the MEng Co-op program\, info on how to apply and admissions requirements. \nPizza will be served! Spots are limited.
