X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/launch-of-the-2026-30-university-academic-plan-markham/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:Launch of the 2026-30 University Academic Plan (Markham) 
DTSTART:20261102T140000Z
DTEND:20261102T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20261021T192900Z
UID:MEC-ab50c20083212eedc22511b8d88070dc@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261102T140000Z
SEQUENCE:3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/1
 0/UAP.png
CATEGORIES:President,Provost
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261021
DESCRIPTION:York’s new 2026-30 University Academic Plan (UAP) sets our a
 cademic direction for the next four years\, built on six principles that w
 ill guide how we teach\, learn\, research and engage with each other and t
 he world beyond York.   \nJoin Lisa Philipps\, Interim President and Vi
 ce-Chancellor\, and Laina Bay-Cheng\, Interim Provost & Vice-President Aca
 demic\, at the Markham drop-in engagement session to learn more about the 
 plan’s principles\, ask questions and share your hopes for where the UAP
  can lead us.  \nBring your ideas. At the events\, you can write your ho
 pes for the plan on seed paper and post them under the principle that spea
 ks to you. The seed paper will later be planted on our campuses\, allowing
  those ideas to grow both symbolically and literally.  \nFaculty\, staff
 \, students and instructors are all welcome and no registration is require
 d. Stay a while or drop by for 15 minutes. Light refreshments will be serv
 ed.  \nLearn more: https://www.yorku.ca/uap2026-30 ( https://www.yorku.c
 a/uap2026-30 )\n  \nLocation: Markham Campus – Atrium  \nDate: Monda
 y\, November 2 \nTime: 9:00 a.m. to 11:00 a.m.  \n  \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/launch-of-the-2026-30-university-academ
 ic-plan-markham/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
