SUMMARY:The Sickling: Blood Drive & Community Film Screening - by Sickle
  Cell Awareness Group of Ontario
LOCATION:Canadian Blood Services\, 67 College St\, Toronto.
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/blooddriveandfilm\n\nHosted by Sickle Cell
  Awareness Group of Ontario (https://www.sicklecellanemia.ca/)\n\nJoin the
  City of Toronto's Confronting Anti-Black Racism Unit\, the Sickle Cell
  Awareness Group of Ontario\, and Canadian Blood Services for two
  connected events focused on sickle cell disease (SCD) and the inequities
  that continue to shape Black experiences of health care. Blood Drive from
  2-4\, screening and discussion from 5:30-9.
END:VEVENT
