SUMMARY: TFCA Critics' Picks: The Righteous
DESCRIPTION:Every month\, a member of the Toronto Film Critics Associatio
 n https://torontofilmcritics.com (TFCA) chooses a film that deserves rene
 wed appreciation. The series will showcase Canadian films\, international
  cinema\, and independent works that represent the breadth (and idiosyncr
 asies) of the membership’s taste. The series begins with The Righteous ht
 tps://www.imdb.com/title/tt11378426/ \, directed by Mark O'Brien\, select
 ed by TFCA vice-president Dave Voigt (In the Seats).\n\n\nTFCA Critics' P
 icks is presented in partnership with Imagine Cinemas https://imaginecine
 mas.com/cinema/carlton/ . The Righteous is generously provided courtesy o
 f Vortex Media.\n\n\nTickets: here https://www.eventbrite.com/e/tfca-crit
 ics-picks-the-righteous-tickets-2003028028754 .
CATEGORIES:Film,Carlton-Imagine-Cinemas
