DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T150000
UID:6ad24b39e06996003a83eca7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A representative from the Canada Revenue Agency (CRA) will pro
 vide an overview of CRA's digital services\, including My Account\, a secu
 re portal that allows you to view your personal income tax and benefit inf
 ormation and manage your tax affairs online. Learn how to register for and
  use My Account to track your refund\, view benefit and credit payments\, 
 update personal information\, set up direct deposit\, receive online mail\
 , and access a variety of CRA services.\nDrop-in.
