 rgy Systems\nLooking to build or advance a career in sustainable energy? L
 assonde’s new professional\, course-based MEng combines advanced enginee
 ring with project management\, commercialization and systems-level thinkin
 g. Complete it in as little as 12 months full-time\, or study part-time wh
 ile you work. Winter and Fall 2027 intakes are available. Learn more\nJoin
  one of the weekly drop-in sessions from October 20 to November 24 to lear
 n more:\n\nTuesday\, October 20\nDrop-in Session: Master of Engineering in
  Sustainable Energy Systems\n11 am – 12 pm\nRegister\n\nTuesday\, Octobe
 r 27\nDrop-in Session: Master of Engineering in Sustainable Energy Systems
 \n11 am – 12 pm\nRegister\n\nThursday\, November 3\nDrop-in Session: Mas
 ter of Engineering in Sustainable Energy Systems\n11 am – 12 pm\nRegiste
 r\n\nThursday\, November 10\nDrop-in Session: Master of Engineering in Sus
 tainable Energy Systems\n11 am – 12 pm\nRegister\n\nThursday\, November 
 24\nDrop-in Session: Master of Engineering in Sustainable Energy Systems\n
 11 am – 12 pm\nRegister\n
