X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Microsoft Reactor Toronto": "https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/317079155/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_microsoft_reactor_toronto
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Microsoft Reactor Toronto
UID:event_317079155@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052747Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T210000
SUMMARY:AI Agents That Know Your Business (Option 1)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nWhat if your AI agents actually und
 erstood your business? Trusted data\, governed semantics\, and business co
 ntext can turn generic AI into experiences grounded in the way your organi
 zation really works. The result: answers and insights that are more releva
