DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261104T143000
UID:6ada3b6d377296003a4dc29d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Explore the beauty of the Korean Moon Jar and traditional moth
 er-of-pearl craft through a contemporary hands-on art experience. Using ge
 nuine mother-of-pearl pieces\, participants decorate a pre-made Moon Jar f
 orm with their own color and pattern design\, creating a unique 4 x 4-inch
  artwork to take home. Beginner-friendly and no previous art experience re
 quired.
