UID:6ace6d32e06996003a833b55@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:​Immerse yourself in the breathtaking beauty of autumn bloom
 s/ berries and bring their rich colors and textures to life on paper as ca
 rds. As the leaves change and nature puts on its most magnificent display\
 , there's no better time to explore your artistic talents and create stunn
 ing floral masterpieces inspired by the vibrant hues of the season with he
 lp of watercolour inks. This workshop will be led by artist Parmeet Arora 
 Bori. Coffee and tea will be served.\nDrop-in. Space is limited to the fi
 rst 10 participants. Free tickets will be handed out starting at 1:45 PM.
