 iors of all skill levels.\nWhether you’re a seasoned player or intereste
 d in learning the game - enjoy friendly matches\, sharpen your strategy\, 
 and connect with others in a relaxed\, supportive environment. Come make y
 our move!\nThis program takes place on Wednesdays from 2:00 - 3:30:\nNovem
 ber 4\, 11\, 18\, 25\nDecember 2\, 9\, 16\, 23\nFree program. Register fo
 r a reminder. Drop-ins are welcome!\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe p
 ersonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Librar
