DESCRIPTION:York University’s Master of Athletic Therapy (MAT) is a full
 -time\, six-term graduate program offered through the School of Kinesiolog
 y & Health Science in the Faculty of Health. Designed to meet the evolving
  demands of the athletic therapy profession\, the MAT combines rigorous ac
 ademic coursework with extensive clinical and field-based learning experie
 nces. Join a virtual or in-person session to connect directly with MAT fac
 ulty\, learn more about the program\, and get answers to your program and 
 admissions questions.\nZOOM LINK FOR VIRTUAL SESSIONS: yorku.zoom.us/my/ma
 tinfo ( https://yorku.zoom.us/my/matinfo )\n\n\nUPCOMING DROP-IN SESSIONS:
 \n\nSeptember 23\, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nSeptember 30\, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.
 \nOctober 7\, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nOctober 13\, 9:00 to 10:00 a.m.\nOctobe
 r 16\, 1:00 to 2:00 p.m.\nOctober 16\, 3:00 to 4:00 p.m.\nOctober 19\, 3:3
 0 to 4:30 p.m. (In Person) – 114 Stong College\nOctober 21\, 10:00 to 11
 :00 a.m.\nOctober 28\, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nNovember 4\, 10:00 to 11:00 a.
 m.\nNovember 11\, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\n\n\n\n
