DESCRIPTION:Toronto's BIGGEST Language Exchange Social Event + Class\n**\\
 #\\#\\# ⚠️ If the class is listed as full\\\, PLEASE JOIN the waitlist
  and we will let guests in based on the class’ needs to balance the numb
 er of Korean & English speakers\\!**\n\n**\\#\\#\\# 👨‍🏫** **KOREAN
  X ENGLISH LANGUAGE EXCHANGE**\n\n* \\*\\*\\*\\****Mini English Class with
  Certified Teacher + Board Games*** **🎲**\n\n**###** **⚠️ Space is 
 VERY LIMITED** **so register ASAP to save your spot!**\n\n***We can only a
 ccept a limited number of guests due to the venue's space limitations.***\
 n\n**💰** **SPECIAL PROMOTION COST** **🎉:**\n**If this is your first 
 or second ever TILE. Event\, the class is** **FREE\, JUST buy 1 item from 
 the Café Princess Menu**\n\n**If you have already attended more than 2 TI
 LE events: pay $5 + buy any menu item from the Café Princess menu**\n**\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-**\n
 \n**###** **📍 LOCATION: CAFÉ PRINCESS**\n\n* **5590 Yonge Street\, Nor
 th York**\n* **Across the street from** **FINCH SUBWAY STATION**\n**near S
 hoppers Drug Mart**\n\n**###** ***📅*** **DAY:** ***Every*** ***Wednesda
 y***\n\n* **🕡 Time: 6:30 PM – 8:45 PM** **⏰**\n\n**Please register 
 ASAP** **if you want to attend on Sept 30th so we can save your spot!**\n\
 n***We had roughly 80 people sign up for the last two events... but we onl
 y have space for 30 people max.***\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -**\n**After registering\, please do the following on Sept. 30th :**\n\n1.
  **✅ Do your best to arrive on time @ Café Princess (6:30 PM)**\n2. **
 ✅ Tell us whether you want to focus on learning/practicing ENGLISH or KO
 REAN**\n3. **✅ Tell us your level: Beginner\, Intermediate\, Advanced or
  Expert**\n4. **✅** **Buy 1 item from the Café Princess Menu** **(This 
 is the only cost if this is your 1st or 2nd class. There is an additional 
 $5 fee starting from your third class onwards)**\n\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
