 lding new relationships and strengthening existing ones.\nThe evening will
  feature:\n• Networking opportunities with fellow Canadians and alumni i
 n New York City\n• A chance to meet representatives from several Canadia
 n universities who will be present to share exciting advancements and deve
 lopments at their schools\n• The opportunity to learn about CANY’s ben
 efits from esteemed partners and representatives\nAttendees are encouraged
  to stop by the York U table to pick up a swag bag and catch up with Heath
 er Auden\, Director\, Alumni Engagement.\n2026 Canadian Universities Alumn
 i Reception\nDate: Wednesday\, Nov. 4\nTime: 6-9 p.m.\nLocation: Sony Hall
