SUMMARY: Rock Legends: Journey
DESCRIPTION:Legendary Rock band Journey is bringing their Final Frontier 
 Tour to Toronto's Scotiabank Arena on Wednesday\, November 4\, part of th
 e band’s massive North American run celebrating more than five decades of
  music.\n\nLed by founder Neal Schon\, JOURNEY will bring a career-spanni
 ng show to Toronto featuring songs that have become part of rock history\
 , including “Don’t Stop Believin’\,” “Any Way You Want It\,” “Faithfully”
  and “Lights.”\n\nThe Toronto stop is one of just five Canadian dates on 
 their newly extended North American tour.\n\nTickets: ticketmaster https:
