  https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc5gPZtYPzGMNlsGAKDh_BWghsH62kTx
 TOZ1wAJXQioidDK_w/viewform\n\nHosted by OPIRG York
  (https://www.opirgyork.org/)\n\n"Thinking Beyond The Market" explores
  housing solutions across Canada\, highlighting how Indigenous-led
  initiatives are already creating meaningful change in response to the
  housing crisis. The film screening will be followed by a Q & A with the
  filmmaker Brian Doucet. We’ll share food and discussion afterwards.
