 s dinner catered by Parallel\, one ofToronto&#x27\;s favourite spots for M
 iddle Eastern cuisine. Expect incredible hummus\, tasty eats\, and plenty 
 of opportunities to schmooze! Whether you&#x27\;re a Flaming Fridays regul
 ar or joining us for the first time\, come meet new friends\, reconnect wi
 th familiar faces\, and celebrate Shabbat with Toronto&#x27\;s LGBTQ+ Jewi
 sh community. 🧆 What: Hummus &amp\; Homos Shabbat Dinner 📅 When: Fri
 day\, November 6 | 7:00 PM 🌈 Who: LGBTQ+ Jews in their 20s\, 30s &amp\;
