SUMMARY: Secret Contact: Mykhaylo album launch 'Pareidolia' w/ noak Aperç
 u Paria
DESCRIPTION:Secret contact presents mykhaylo's new album Pareidolia\n\n"B
 lurring human and non-human\, voice and instrument\, Pareidolia by Toront
 o-based producer Mykhaylo is incensed with vocals and electronics that be
 nd and shift perception. Dancefloor morphs to cavern as the familiar stra
 ys into immense\, subterranean echo blanketed by the stark deep and dark.
  Blotted black and unknowable\, voids fill with whispers\, disturbances\,
  and fragments\, hazed and tensely layered. High above\, words and sound 
 become silky\, shimmering illusions\, evasive forms of plumes and vapour.
 "\n\nwith support from:\n\nNoak (mtl) - sentimental hard electronics\n\nA
 perçu - experimental roughed up club music\n\nParia - sonically unbound f
 uture music\n\nMACEL studios is located at 658 Queen St W\, Toronto\n\nDO
 ORS 7PM\nSOUND 8PM\nEND 11PM\n\nTickets: RA https://ra.co/events/2558418
CATEGORIES:DJ/Club/Rave,MACEL-Studios,Concert
