DESCRIPTION:Rather than our usual start at a subway station\, today we wil
 l start at the Shops at Don Mills. We will w alk through the lovely forest
 ed ravines of Don Mills\, alongside Deer Lick Creek where there was a disc
 overy of ancient artifacts. We will pass through Charles Sauroil Conservat
 ion Area and walk alongside the East Branch of the Don River and under the
  Rainbow\, ending our walk where we started. Meet at about 10:00 AM at Sam
 son Mews – Shops at Don Mills (between Chick Fil-A & PI CO restaurants\,
  facing Don Mills Rd)\, southwest of Lawrence Ave E and Don Mills Rd. Ther
 e are washrooms in Samson Mews. The walk will begin at 10:10 sharp. Direct
 ions to Shops at Don Mills via TTC: from Eglinton LRT...
