DESCRIPTION:1-on-1 Career Consultations with ACCES Employment\nExplore the
  incredible resources and expertise offered by ACCES Employment. Connect w
 ith an Employment Consultant to get tailored resume reviews\, invaluable i
 nterview tips\, and a wealth of additional support.\nBook a\nfree 30-minut
 e appointment\nand embark on a remarkable journey toward your dream job.\n
 Registration is required\n. Limited spots are available. Appointments are 
 limited to one per person.\nREGISTER HERE.\nConsultant #1\nConsultations w
 ill take place in the Business\, Science and Technology Department (\n4th 
 Floor\n). For questions\, email\nclbst@tpl.ca\nor call the North York Cent
 ral Library\, Business\, Science and Technology Department at\n416-395-561
 3\n.\nIf no slots are available on your desired consultation date\, contac
 t ACCES Employment directly for an appointment at\n416-443-9008\n(North Yo
 rk Location) /\n416-921-1800\n(Downtown Location). Or visit\naccesemployme
 nt.ca
