UID:6ada45659dbc2b002c9054e3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Turn on a light\, spin a motor\, and activate a speaker all wi
 th snap circuits. Snap circuit kits offer various electrical experiments 
 and you are welcome to try to make your own circuit.\nThis program is part
  of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after sc
 hool and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\,
  nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\
