DESCRIPTION:Join us ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/PZdlxB8lRoiZA
 RmVNrNhHg#/registration ) on November 10th to learn more about the PhD in 
 Sociology ( https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/sociology/ ) offered at York!
 \nYork’s Graduate Program in Sociology is one of the most dynamic centre
 s of social theory and research in Canada. We have a well-established nati
 onal and international reputation for critical scholarship\, interdiscipli
 nary and sociological theory. The program boasts a large number of researc
 h chairs and directors from multiple departments\, providing students with
  a rich array of research opportunities and ties across disciplines. \nTh
 e outstanding quality and diversity of our graduate students is one of our
  greatest strengths. Our students have been very successful in scholarship
  competitions and have won an impressive number of national and internatio
 nal awards for academic achievement.\nRegistration is required.  ( https:
 //yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/PZdlxB8lRoiZARmVNrNhHg#/registration )\n
