DESCRIPTION:Prepare for the Citizenship test in small groups\, with the support of our Volunteer Mentors! \n\nWeekly sessions\nLearn about the test’s content and structure\nPractice with sample quizzes\nNetwork and share experiences\nLearn about Canada and the Canadian Culture\n\nFor Permanent Residents and Convention Refugees. \nTo register\, contact Rubeen at rchauhan@culturelink.ca or 437-249-7103.
