DESCRIPTION:Join other book lovers in your community and participate in li
 vely discussions of popular books. This book club will meet every First Tu
 esday of the month for a lively discussion in a welcoming\, relaxed settin
 g. New members are always welcome and encouraged to join.\nSeptember 8\n\,
  2026 -\nThe book of Lost Names by Kristin Harmel\nOctober 13\n\, 2026 -\n
 On the Ravine by Vincent Lam\nNovember 10\, 2026 -\nBad Cree by Jessica Jo
 hns\nDecember 8\, 2026 - The Thursday Murder Club by Richard Osman\nCopies
  of the book are available for borrowing at the Port Union Library.\nDrop-
 in\, no registration necessary.
