DESCRIPTION:Join a staff-moderated discussion of select nonfiction titles.
  Explore different types of nonfiction\, real-life stories\, biographies/m
 emoirs\, gain new knowledge\, and engage in lively discussions.\nThis mont
 h's featured title is\nLifespan\nby David Sinclair.\nThis program is hoste
 d on\nZoom\n. The Zoom information and link will be shared over email.\nIn
 formation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is col
 lected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sect
 ions 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for even
 t and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how 
 the library handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff a
 t\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 
 2G8.\n[Start with your own unique description of the Book Club and use the
  'Title' button to link to the title being discussed for the month]
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a4eaf9a71ef13620051875b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
