DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261110T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261110T200000
UID:6ace635c377296003a4bab7e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this class\, you will learn how to prepare for the Canadian
  Citizenship Exam using the following:\nToronto Public Library website\nLe
 arning Express Library with your library card\nBrainfuse with your library
  card\nYour Citizenship Counts website\nFind your elected officials using 
 Federal\, Provincial\, and Municipal websites
LOCATION:Highland Creek\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ace635c377296003a4bab7e
