CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Health,Graduate Program 
 in Nursing
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260619
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in pursuing your graduate education in Nurs
 ing? We invite you to join our virtual Graduate Nursing Information Sessio
 n to learn more about York University’s Graduate Nursing programs.\nOur 
 graduate program offers cutting-edge innovation grounded in foundational n
 ursing values—designed for nurses who want to become leaders\, educators
 \, and advanced nurse practitioners. The program integrates relational pri
 nciples with theoretical knowledge in areas such as transformational and o
 rganizational leadership\, caring and narrative pedagogies\, global and lo
 cal policy\, and human health experiences.\nEvent Details\n\nDate: Novemb
 er 10\, 2026\nTime: 6:00–7:00 p.m.\nLocation: Virtual (Zoom)\nJoin lin
 k: yorku.zoom.us/s/94632597264 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/s/94632597264 )\n\
 nLearn More\n\nProgram information: futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/progr
 ams ( https://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nAdmissions ques
 tions: fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca )\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260625
ORGANIZER;CN="Graduate Program in Nursing":MAILTO:gradnurs@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
