ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/1
 0/AA26.png
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261001
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a night to remember at the York U Alumni Awards on
  Nov. 10 at TIFF Lightbox in downtown Toronto.\nBe a part of the festiviti
 es as we honour this year’s alumni recipients who have made remarkable c
 ontributions to their fields and changed the world for the better.\nIt pro
 mises to be a memorable evening filled with live entertainment\, special g
 uests\, delicious food and networking opportunities as we celebrate this s
 pecial occasion with the York community.\nDate: Tuesday\, November 10\, 20
 26\nLocation: TIFF Lightbox – 350 King St W\, Toronto\, ON M5V 3X5\n6:15
  p.m. | Doors open\n7 p.m. | Awards show\n8:30 p.m. | Reception\, food and
  networking (includes one drink ticket)\nDress code: Formal attire\nTicket
