SUMMARY:Launch of the 2026-30 University Academic Plan (Glendon) 
DTSTART:20261111T180000Z
DTEND:20261111T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20261021T192900Z
UID:MEC-6116829f7b4b521adc60043e97240958@events.yorku.ca
