DESCRIPTION:A representative from the\nCanada Revenue Agency (CRA)\nwill e
 xplain how filing your taxes can help you access benefits and credits you 
 may be eligible to receive. Learn about available programs\, eligibility r
 equirements\, and how to apply. Topics may include:\nCanada Groceries and 
 Essentials Benefit (CGEB)\nCanada Child Benefit (CCB)\nCanada Workers Bene
 fit (CWB)\nDisability Tax Credit (DTC)\nChild Disability Benefit\nCanada C
 aregiver Credit\nEligibility for benefits and credits\nPresented as part o
 f Financial Literacy Month.\nRegistration:\nThis virtual event is free to 
 join and will take place on\nZoom\n.\nRegister to receive an email with de
 tails on how to join the session. Join live\, as there will not be a recor
 ding for this event.\nCaptions will be available.\nNeed help with Zoom?\n-
 \nJoining and participating in a Zoom webinar\n-\nZoom Privacy Statement\n
