SUMMARY:Grammar On! 6: What’s This?
DTSTART:20261112T163000Z
DTEND:20261112T173000Z
DTSTAMP:20260925T211100Z
UID:MEC-309e3fb6c98132ad9065bbadfe5c2319@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261112T163000Z
SEQUENCE:12
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 09/students-event.jpg
CATEGORIES:LA&amp\;PS Addressing Anti-Black Racism,LA&amp\;PS Colleges,LA&
 amp\;PS Community Hub,LA&amp\;PS Founders College,LA&amp\;PS McLaughlin Co
 llege,LA&amp\;PS New College,LA&amp\;PS Student Success,LA&amp\;PS Student
 s All,LA&amp\;PS Students-Graduate,LA&amp\;PS Students-International,LA&am
 p\;PS Students-Undergrad,LA&amp\;PS Vanier College,LA&amp\;PS Writing Cent
 re,LA&amp\;PS Writing Department
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260925
DESCRIPTION:Workshop 6: What’s This?\nName that this!\nWhich this?\nThat
  this.\nWait\, whuuut?\nThat this there. Name that this.\nBut to which 
 this are you referring?\nThat one: name that this.\nThis is going nowhere.
   Exactly.\nNo RSVPs. Just click to join!\n
