UID:6ade51a4901b02002cc50ea3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:November is Make a Will Month and TPL is delighted to host the
  Ontario Bar Association. Learn about the importance of having a will and 
 powers of attorney for you and your family. A\nmember of the\nOntario Bar 
 Association\nwho practices Trusts and Estates Law will speak about the ele
 ments of a will\, what happens if you don’t have one\, what are powers o
 f attorney\, why they are important\, and special considerations to keep i
 n mind when preparing your estate and care plans. Please note that this p
 rogram is for general information only\, not for drafting individual wills
 .\nRegistration required\n. Drop-ins are welcome until capacity is reached
 .
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium\, 2nd floor
