SUMMARY:Meaningful Conversations and Cocktails!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Join us for **Meaningful Conversations and Cocktails!** — a relaxed and 
 friendly Sunday evening filled with interesting discussions\, laughter and
  great company!\n\nWe'll explore a variety of topics\, including relations
 hips\, friendships\, travel\, music\, movies\, personal experiences\, work
 -life balance\, psychology\, spirituality\, philosophy\, the future\, huma
 n nature and whatever else sparks our curiosity. We'll keep things lighthe
 arted and steer clear of political debates!\n\nWhether you're outgoing or 
 a little reserved\, everyone is welcome to share their thoughts\, exchange
  ideas and enjoy some refreshing drinks in a comfortable\, welcoming atmos
 phere.\n\nDate: Sunday\, November 15\, 2026\nArrival Time: 6:00 PM\nLocati
 on: The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub\nAddress: 1999 Avenue Road\, Toronto\nMeeti
 ng Area: Back dining area\n\nJoined by my other social groups too :)\nLook
 ing forward to a wonderful evening of conversation and new connections!\n\
 nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nEvent Detail
 s\n**Event: Meaningful Conversations and Cocktails!**\n\n• Enjoy meaning
 ful conversations on a variety of interesting and relatable topics\n• Me
 et friendly people\, exchange ideas and make new connections\n• Relax ov
 er cocktails\, refreshments and delicious food in a welcoming pub atmosphe
 re\n• Enjoy a casual\, pressure-free evening filled with laughter\, frie
 ndship and great company\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n**Event Fee
  & Payment:**\n$5 per person\nE-transfer in advance to: [steveflemming11@g
 mail.com](mailto:stevefleming11@gmail.com)\nOr pay cash at the door\n━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━\nFood & Drinks\nMinimum purchase: One beverage or appetizer per 
 person.\nFood and drink specials available!\n━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nParking\nFree r
 esidential street parking nearby
