SUMMARY:Moving Stories
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T153000
UID:6acfbd2429c3d600332fe043@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:An introduction into the enriching world of art and creative s
 torytelling through movement and music. These activities have been proven 
 to improve circulation\, retain joint mobility\, promote mental stimulatio
 n\, improve posture and coordination\, and build strength and balance. No 
 previous movement experience required.
LOCATION:Annette Street
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6acfbd2429c3d600332fe043
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
