 d during the After School Club for participants. Ingredient lists will be 
 available. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by donors.\nMonday 
 November 2: Crochet\n- Join us to learn how to start crocheting!\nMonday N
 ovember 9: Perler Beads\n- Create fun 2D figures and designs using colourf
 ul Perler beads.\nMonday November 16: Bookmark Making\n- Design and decora
 te your own bookmark to use during your reading adventures.\nMonday Novemb
 er 23: Chef Yumiko Boba Milk Workshop\n- In this 45-minute workshop\, chil
 dren will learn how to prepare a classic black sugar boba milk\, including
  decorating and mixing techniques\, as well as the breakdown of core ingre
 dients. Contains dairy and sugar. No caffeine.\nFood allergy notice: Plea
 se be aware that food will be used in this program. Certain food ingredien
 ts may cause allergic reactions in some people.\nMonday November 30: Mario
  Kart Tournament\n- Test your Mario Kart skills head-to-head with others!\
