DESCRIPTION:Want to further develop your sewing skills? Our intermediate s
 ewing class will take what was learned in sewing basics and add more compl
 ex elements such as a zipper. We will be creating a small bag with a funct
 ioning zipper. All materials will be provided.\nNOTE\n: Knowledge of sewin
 g is required. Sewing basics instruction will not be included.\nChildren u
 nder 13 must be accompanied by an adult.\nRegistration is required.\nRegis
 tration starts on November 3\, 2026 @ 12:30pm\nNote: Your spot will not be
  guaranteed after 5 minutes of the start of the program.\nInformation Coll
 ection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the 
 Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 2
 0(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program 
