UID:6acfad7c11bbf300684c0169@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, Coach Joshua Watkis will address the self-s
 crutiny faced by youth in the digital age by using poetry and self-reflect
 ion as tools for positive reinforcement.\nLearn how to identify\, affirm\,
  and articulate your value by mastering the basics of metaphors and simile
 s and utilizing the psychological and poetic power of targeted repetition 
 and group affirmations.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth 
