 e also register through CultureLink's form\nHERE\n.\nIf you have additiona
 l questions\, please contact Forest Hill Staff. You may also direct questi
 ons to the English Conversation Circle coordinator\, Karen Au-Yeung at\nk
 au-yeung@culturelink.ca\n.
