 il\, powdered sugar\, vegan chocolate chips (ALL\ngluten free\, vegan\, ha
 lal\, allergen friendly)\n·\nMini Oreos (ALL\nvegan\, halal\, allergy fri
 endly\n)\nFood colouring & sprinkles (ALL\nallergen friendly\, with the op
 tion not to use it)\nCandy (ALL allergen friendly\, some halal as well\n)\
 nThis workshop is part of the Teen Social Health and Wellness programming.
