UID:6aaa9fe419094f0c693890f1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the 3rd Tuesday evening of every month to discuss b
 ooks in a friendly and social atmosphere.\nNovember Book Title:\nAlias Gra
 ce\nby Margaret Atwood\nDecember Book Title:\n"A" Is for Alibi\nby Sue Gra
 fton\nTo get a copy of the book\, please visit the 1st floor desk at Alber
 t Campbell Library. New members are always welcome.\nDrop-in or register f
 or a reminder at 416-396-8890 or speak to staff at the desk.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Small Meeting Room\, 2nd floor
