UID:6ad8efef11bbf300684cd1b6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:November is Make a Will Month and TPL is delighted to host the
  Ontario Bar Association. Learn about the importance of having a will and 
 powers of attorney for you and your family.  A member of the\nOntario Bar
  Association\nwho practices Trusts and Estates Law will speak about:\nthe 
 elements of a will and what happens if you don’t have one\nwhat are powe
 rs of attorney and why they are important\nspecial considerations to keep 
 in mind when preparing your estate and care plans.\nNote\, this program is
  for general information only\, not for drafting individual wills.\nRegist
 er online or call 416-396-3975.  Drop-ins welcome too.\n-------\nInformati
 on Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected 
