SUMMARY:Northern District Book Club—Evenings
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261118T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261118T200000
UID:6a5f86437b79214226aa1376@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a friendly\, spirited discussion of a different bo
 ok on the third Wednesday of each month. We read an eclectic mix of mostly
  contemporary fiction.\nThere is also an afternoon session to discuss the 
 same book on the second Wednesday of each month at 2:00 p.m.  You are we
 lcome at either or both!\nSeptember 16\, 2026:\nOrbital\nby Samantha Harve
 y\nOctober 21\, 2026:\nPerfection\nby Lorenzo Patronico\nNovember 18\, 202
 6:\nStone Yard Devotional\nby Charlotte Wood\nDecember 16\, 2026:\nMaybe Y
 ou Should Talk to Someone\nby Lori Gottlieb
LOCATION:Northern District\, Main Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a5f86437b79214226aa1376
