UID:6ad25264035faf0033dd1696@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this advanced workshop\, participants will be taken step-by
 -step through creating a still life digital painting from a photo referenc
 e in Adobe Photoshop using a drawing tablet. The instructor will touch bas
 e on important art principles that will be applied to painting in Adobe Ph
 otoshop. Prior experience with drawing tablets and Photoshop is required f
 or this class. Though\, we will briefly go over the user interface and var
 ious tools we will be using.\nNote: You will need your own working copy of
  Adobe Photoshop and a drawing tablet for this class.\nRegistration will s
 tart 2 weeks before this class\n. This program is hosted on Zoom. The Zoom
