DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T200000
UID:6ad6ab14de300e00451b90b0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover and learn about the entire process of creative screen
  printing. Create hand drawn art\, make a silkscreen and then expose their
  art onto their own silkscreen. Then screen print the art onto readymade i
 tems. This workshop focuses on individual creativity\, self expression and
  upcycling. Participants will learn and do all the basics of photo emulsio
 n screen printing and be inspired to reuse existing fabric\, clothing\, te
 xtiles.
LOCATION:St. Clair/Silverthorn\, Community Room- 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad6ab14de300e00451b90b0
