DESCRIPTION:Join L’Agapanthe and Friends of Allan Gardens for FLOURISH on
  Thursday\, November 19\, 2026\, at the Allan Gardens Palm House in Toron
 to. An intimate bilingual evening of opera\, art\, recognition and commun
 ity\, the gala features soprano Christina Smith\, a three-course French-C
 anadian dinner\, the 2026 FLOURISH Honours\, a silent auction featuring w
 orks by David Tomlin\, and dancing. The evening supports refugees at L’Ag
 apanthe and the future of Allan Gardens. Red carpet begins at 6:00 p.m. a
 nd the program begins at 6:30 p.m. Individual admission is $250\; tables 
 of eight are $2\,000\; VIP tables of ten are $2\,500. Seating is limited.
  Reserve at https://luma.com/flourishgala https://luma.com/flourishgala\n
 \nVIP Reception 5:00PM at L’Agapanthe\, 179 Gerrard Street East\, Toronto
