DESCRIPTION:Learn the basics of hand sewing with needle and thread. Over t
 hree sessions we will practice stitching\, cutting and assembling the piec
 es for our project: a felt teddy/bag charm. As each week will build on th
 e previous session\, attendance at all three sessions is required to compl
 ete the project.\nFor children ages 5-12\, registration required.\nInforma
 tion Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collecte
 d by the Toronto Public Library under the\nPublic Libraries Act\, sections
