 nd program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the
  library\nhandles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at 
 answerline@tpl.ca\, 416-397-\n5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8
LOCATION:Northern District\, Room 200
