SUMMARY:November ART Crawl (#2): Tour 3 top private galleries/spaces ($10 
 per person)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nWe will continue with our monthly **Ar
 t Crawls**!\n\n***Please read everything over first.***\n\n\\*\\*\\*Novemb
 er Art Crawl #2 = Saturday November 21rst (1pm-3pm)\n\n18 people/members t
 his time.\n\nSTARTING in the Yonge/Dundas area.\n\n**$10 per person.**\n\n
 **\\*\\*\\*Sent via e-transfer when you signup/rsvp.**\n\n**I'm not able t
 o HOLD space for you.**\n\n***--We will visit 3 different*** (downtown/wes
 t end/east end) galleries each month **(with short walks between each one)
 **\n\nEach month will be different galleries and/or artist-run centres.\n\
 n\\*\\*We'll meet the Gallery owners/artists/directors--\nwho will lead us
  in tours and conversation at each stop.\n\nNO weather cancellations---**w
 e will carry on!**\n\nNO cancellations/no refunds or any re-scheduling if 
 you cannot make it.\n\n\\-\\-\\-Check your calendars and PLAN ahead if you
  can join us\\-\\-and please be on time\\. We're not able to wait for you\
 \. Sorry\n\nAre you interested in ART/artists--**and learning/visiting**\n
 **the exceptional local commercial galleries we have in Toronto? With othe
 r MEETUP members.**\n\nSaturday November 21 ***(1pm-3pm)***\n\nOnce I have
  18 **confirmations** from Meetup members (you)--I will email you the star
 t location of our November #2 ART Crawl!!\n\n**Our first stop**. Yonge/Dun
 das area (we then head EAST)\n\nIf interested\, please email me $10.\n\nIn
 clude your first name only\, and email address for a reply.\n\n**I will th
 en confirm you.**\n\nAnd will firm up our itinerary with you next week.\n\
 nSee you on Saturday November 21rst--if you're confirmed--watch for an ema
 il directly from me!!\n\n***We are doing this again in November--as many e
 xceptional current exhibitions. And*** ongoing all Winter---as we find som
 e interesting spaces and exhibitions.\n\nEach month will be posted separat
 ely.\n\nYou can email me directly here:\n\ntorontoisculture@gmail.com\n\nG
 reg\n\nThank you.
