 mToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\nOptions for prepaid table/ticket pack
 ages (ONE ticket = everything mentioned):\n\n1) The 3rd Wheel: $363\nIncl
 udes: 3 General Admissions\; 1 Bottle of Stoli Vodka\n\n2) Regular Packag
 e: $700\nIncludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Regular Bottles of Choice (ma
 y email wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify c
