 inment\; Wiggly Events\; Wiggle Room Toronto\; Sunshine Frequencies\n\n~ 
 WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code of conduct and reserve the ri
 ght to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggle Room is a Safer Dance Space. We 
