 every month\, on the last Tuesday.\nEnjoy a variety of topics\, guest spe
 akers\, lively conversation\, & fun activities!\nNovember's social will be
  a presentation by Canada Revenue Agency (CRA) - Be Scam Smart!\nThis is a
