SUMMARY:Managing Your Money
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T190000
UID:6ad2a465035faf0033dd28fe@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this session:\nApply the financial knowledge to be able to 
 make informed decisions about money.\nRead and understand a pay stub and i
 ts relationship to a T4 slip.\nCreate a budget to help develop a savings p
 lan.\nUnderstand and apply saving money and reducing spending to achieve s
 uccess.\nDevelop ways to invest savings and achieve financial success.\nDe
 velop a basic understanding of credit lenders\, credit scores\, and credit
  reports\, including what they mean and actions that can improve your scor
 e.\nQ&A.\nPresented by Chartered Professional Accountants Canada\nRegistra
 tion required. Walk-ins welcome as space permits.\nInformation Collection 
