DESCRIPTION:Conversation is the source of innovation!\nJoin TPL Innovation
  Council member\nZahra Ebrahim\nfor a series of lively book discussions ab
 out how we can build a better world by getting better at talking with eac
 h other.\nOur November book is\nHow to Stay Sane in an Age of Division\n\,
  by Elif Shafak - a short and lovely collection of essays on listening\, d
 emocracy\, and the path to a kinder and wiser future. Copies of the book
  will be available to registered book club members at the Junction Triang
 le circulation desk.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informa
 tion on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Pub
 lic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information wi
 ll only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluati
 on. Questions about how the library handles your information can be direct
 ed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge 
 Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
