DESCRIPTION:Laughter is good for the soul! Explore creative exercises and 
 games to connect\, create and laugh!\nWant to get ready for a presentation
  at school? Prep your acting skills for an audition? Or feel more confiden
 t in general? Or do you just want to have some fun!? Join us!\nHosted by Y
 ou Amaze You (Y.A.Y)\, an organization that uses improv and interactive ex
 periences to help young people build confidence\, connection\, and well-be
 ing. Drop in. No registration required. TEENS only.\nThis workshop is part
  of the Teen Social Health and Wellness programming. Generously supported 
 by The Estate of Claudia Krawchuk.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub serv
