 s.\nPlease Note: Any schedule changes or session cancellations will be com
 municated through eClass. Students are encouraged to check eClass regularl
 y for the most up-to-date information. During Fall Reading Week\, Peer-Ass
 isted Study Sessions\, Tutoring\, and Office Hours are typically not offer
 ed. If a session is scheduled during this period\, details will be communi
 cated by the course instructor and posted in eClass.\nLearn more about PAS
 S ( https://students.yorku.ca/PASS ).\n
