SUMMARY:VCP presents LADY AUDLEY’S SECRET
DTSTART:20261126T130000Z
DTEND:20261129T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261013T190700Z
UID:MEC-c73edcecd97f8e999b5cd937d5e6827e@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261126T130000Z
SEQUENCE:8
CATEGORIES:LA&amp\;PS Colleges,LA&amp\;PS Open to the Public,LA&amp\;PS St
 udent Success,LA&amp\;PS Students All,LA&amp\;PS Vanier College Production
 s
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261013
DESCRIPTION:An Original Version of Miss Braddon’s popular Novel\, In Two
  Acts by C. H. Hazelwood Adapted from the 1862 novel of the same name\, La
 dy Audley’s Secret is a classic example of Victorian melodrama. Concerni
 ng the ambitious\, unscrupulous Lady Audley who\, in order to preserve her
  present situation is prepared\, when an unwanted husband returns\, to att
 empt to get rid of him in the garden well. But she is observed – and str
 uggle and twist as she may\, neither bribery nor attempted arson avail her
 . Nemesis overtakes her and tragedy ensues. Find out what she is hiding an
 d the lengths to which she will go to in order to protect Lady Audley’s 
 Secret.\nDirected by Jean-Paul Yovanoff\nNov. 26 – Nov. 29\, 2026\nThur-
 Sat @ 7:30pm | Sun @ 2:30pm\nFred Thury Studio Theatre\, 258 Vanier Colleg
 e\nTo reach the theatre\, take the stairs or elevator on the east side of 
 Vanier College to the second floor.\nPay-What-You-Can-Afford Tickets Sugge
 sted Pricing: VCP Supporter $50 | General $25 | VCP Alumni $20 | Students 
 $15 | VCP Current Company $10\nAvailable online or CASH ONLY at door\nWebs
 ite: Lady Audley’s Secret | Vanier College Productions ( https://www.yor
 ku.ca/laps/vcp/current-season/lady-audleys-secret/ )\nEmail: vcp@yorku.ca 
 ( mailto:vcp@yorku.ca ) Facebook: @VanierCollegeProductions Instagram: @va
 ncproductions\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261019
LOCATION:Fred Thury Studio Theatre\, 258 Vanier College
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.yorku.ca/laps/vcp/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
