DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T153000
UID:6adcc85029c3d60033322030@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This class is for absolute beginners who are curious about buy
 ing an Android device\, or who have just acquired one and want to understa
 nd how it operates.   In this class\, you will learn about different parts
  of an Android device\, what an Operating System is\, and how to start you
 r device. You will also learn to navigate the Android  home screen\; lea
 rn about settings in Android\, and finally tips for troubleshooting and re
 commended resources for further learning.
LOCATION:Deer Park\, Main Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6adcc85029c3d60033322030
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
