DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T153000
UID:6ada53ebad4027659154af74@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for 4 weeks of fun afternoons where participants can c
 onnect over shared musical experiences while enjoying some light refreshme
 nts. Music Share for Seniors staff will play your favourite songs while yo
 u share the memories they inspire. Or sit back\, listen and enjoy the musi
 cal experiences of those around you. Get ready to jam out while connecting
  with new friends! Music Share for Seniors is an organization dedicated to
  reducing senior social isolation through personalized music-based program
 s and meaningful social interaction. This program is geared towards older 
 adults and seniors. Register in advance or drop-in on the day. Participant
 s are encouraged to join every week and connect with others!\nThursdays\, 
 November 12\, 19\, 26\, December 3\n2:00 – 3:30pm\nInformation Collectio
 n Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toron
 to Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\
 , and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program regis
 tration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles
  your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.c
 a\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201\, 2nd Floor.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ada53ebad4027659154af74
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
