DESCRIPTION:Discover how food fuels performance in this interactive sessio
 n led by a registered dietician. Learn what to eat\, when to fuel\, and ho
 w to spot nutrition myths. Build your own athlete meal plan\, test your kn
 owledge through games\, and explore exciting careers in sports\, health an
 d nutrition. Perfect for active teens looking to level up both on and off 
 the field.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a we
 lcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful sta
 ff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Dro
 p by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Parliament Street\, 2nd Floor Youth Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad13a7196ec3a003adada2e
