SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Spoken Word Workshop - Studying the Greats: Dionne Bran
 d & Lillian Allen
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T180000
UID:6a9afe18442d35226f669c0d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, Coach Desiree McKenzie will focus on the wo
 rks of acclaimed Toronto poets\, Dionne Brand and Lillian Allen\, through
  detailed analysis and exploration of their poetry. Participants will exa
 mine how these poets use language as liberation\, sound as story\, and fo
 rm as resistance\, and then apply these powerful techniques to inspire an
 d shape new original writing.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. 
 Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\
 , where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are 
 offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to 
 find out more.
