DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T200000
UID:6ad252769dbc2b002c8f0b74@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a tablet at home? Want to enhance your digital pai
 nting skills? Join us online to learn new techniques!\nIn this third part
  of the Digital Painting Series\, learn to create a digital landscape pai
 nting in Photoshop using the Wacom Tablet. Receive an introductory lesson 
 on perspective and a walkthrough on how to apply these skills to your digi
 tal painting. Prior experience with a drawing tablet is\nrequired\n\, as w
 e will not being covering how to use the equipment today.\nNote: You will 
 need your own working copy of Adobe Photoshop and a drawing tablet for thi
 s class.\nRegistration will start 2 weeks before this class\n. This progra
 m is hosted on Zoom. The Zoom information and link will be shared over ema
 il.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form
  is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act
 \, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used f
 or event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Registrants m
 ay be contacted to fill out a brief survey following the program. Question
 s about how the library handles your information can be directed to Answer
 line staff at answerline@tpl.ca\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toront
 o ON M4W 2G8.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad252769dbc2b002c8f0b74
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
