DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for an ‘Applying to Grad School at 
 York: International Applications 101’ session\, to learn more about York
  University and our graduate admissions process.\nThis session is intended
  for applicants who require a visa/study permit to study in Canada. This s
 ession will run about an hour\, and will cover “Why York”\, eligibilit
 y\, requirements\, financial information\, how to apply\, and more.\nPleas
 e note that during these sessions we will not be able to answer any questi
 ons about Schulich School of Business programs\, or Osgoode Law School pro
 grams. For all other master’s programs\, doctoral programs\, and graduat
 e diplomas\, this is the session for you!\nRegistration is required. To RS
 VP or learn more\, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zo
 om.us/webinar/register/WN_KnexXvbqSOuHPYQ3yaQx9A ).\nLearn more about our 
 graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://f
 uturestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions\, please ema
 il us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA.\n
