SUMMARY:Closing Session & Reflection
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261127T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261127T200000
UID:6abe8bb10f56a0002cd503c3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A closing session for all participants to reflect on what they
  built and learned\, celebrate their work\, and leave with resources and p
 athways to continue their civic tech journey beyond the residency.\nArrive
  30 minutes before or stay 30 minutes after the program for one-on-one con
 sultations.\nThis program is part of TPL's Innovator in Residence series f
 ocused on civic innovation. From October 5 to November 28\, join programs\
 , workshops and one-on-one consultations led by technology strategist Isma
 il Mohamud to learn how technology can help you create positive change in 
 your community. Learn more at\ntpl.ca/iir\n.\nInformation Collection Notic
 e:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Publ
