X-SOURCE-ID:yohomo
SUMMARY:SOOK-YIN LEE ANTI-BAND &amp\; friends!
DTSTART:20261127T200000
DTEND:20261127T200000
UID:9dc19759a1f0589afa73aaaaf81dde42@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:SOOK-YIN LEE ANTI-BAND &amp\; friends: MyGirl BoyGirl (members
  of New Chance) STEPHEN JACKMAN-TORKOFF Sadstab &amp\; JIEUN KIM Fri. Nov.
  27 Doors: 8PM Show: 9PM Hot off the heels of a TransCanada tour\, Canadia
 n multimedia icon\, Sook-Yin Lee\, returns to TORONTO/ Tkaronto with her A
 nti-Band featuring Dylan Gamble (Hot Garbage) on guitar\, dancer Ronnie Cl
 arke\, and performance artist/ vocalist Sarah Kilpack. Lee brings together
  some of her fave artists for an adventurous gathering: Stephen Jackman-To
 rkoff\, wandering poet\, painter\, and lover of life\, is known for their 
 striking DIY performance odysseys. MyGirl BoyGirl (members of New Chance) 
 features Victoria Cheong\, experimental pop and electronic music composer 
 and producer\, and Johnny Spence\, composer\, musician\, and sound designe
 r. Meanwhile\, the life of the party is DJ Sadstab\, tattoo artist\, and b
 rilliant force of nature who helps run Play de Record\, the legendary inde
 pendent record store. Experience LIVE ART courtesy of muralist Jieun Kim\,
  an art instigator who will get you making art too! “Sook-Yin Lee&#x27\;
 s set was nothing short of a joyful transcendent experience.” Exclaim! M
 agazine This is an 19+ event Presented by Hidden Lane ‍
LOCATION:2A Osler St\, 2A Osler St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/sook-yin-lee-anti-band-friends
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
