SUMMARY:City Walk - Wandering Warden Woods and Beyond
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261129T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261129T130000
UID:11a1fe4f54c0a4582f8c9f13ec7aae28@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:Meet at about 10:00 AM at Victoria Park Station\, in front of 
 the station\, on east side of Victoria Park Avenue. We will begin the walk
  at 10:10 sharp. We will walk in a loop\, going about 7.3 Km and returning
  to the start\, with two bathroom stops. At the beginning of the walk\, we
  will visit a new modular subsidized housing unit finished about three yea
 rs ago on Macy Avenue. Then we will proceed to Warden Woods trail up to St
 . Clair\, then west along St. Clair to the Dawes Road Cemetery. We will th
 en south go through the cemetery and take side streets to Pharmacy and Vic
 toria Park. From Victoria Park we take a trail down to the Don River and t
 hen east back to Victoria Park station. The route wi...
LOCATION:Victoria Park Station\, in front of the station\, on east side of
  Victoria Park Avenue
URL:https://www.tbn.ca/widget/event-6890749
X-SOURCE:Toronto Bicycling Network
END:VEVENT
