SUMMARY:If Your Wallet Could Talk…
DTSTART:20261130T173000Z
DTEND:20261130T193000Z
DTSTAMP:20261030T040200Z
UID:MEC-9a9e0713c813c15dac6e857cd7e33e05@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261130T173000Z
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Financial Literacy Month,Markham Campus
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261029
DESCRIPTION:What would your wallet say if it could talk?\nCelebrate Financ
 ial Literacy Month with a fun and interactive activity that gets students 
 talking about money. Spin the wheel\, answer a money-themed prompt\, and e
 xplore topics like spending\, saving\, borrowing\, budgeting\, and financi
 al planning. Share your perspective\, learn from everyday financial scenar
 ios\, discover York resources that support financial success\, and win a p
 rize along the way.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029
LOCATION:Markham Campus Atrium
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/if-your-wallet-could-talk/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
