DESCRIPTION:WRAP is for anyone looking to strengthen their well-being
 —whether you’re supporting your mental health\, managing stress\, or s
 imply wanting to feel more balanced and resilient in daily life. This tw
 o hour workshop uses the principles of the WRAP system to help you develop
  your own personalized wellness plan when faced with a significant life ev
 ent.\nParticipants will receive a certificate of participation upon progra
 m completion\, but this program does not contribute to a WRAP certificate.
  Find more WRAP program options at TPL\nhere.\nTTC Presto tickets will be 
 provided. Snacks and refreshments are provided for all participants. Ing
 redient lists will be available at the program.\nThis program is in coll
 aboration with\nHope + Me\n. Hope + Me is solely responsible for the prote
 ction of personal information collected through the program registration p
 rocess.
LOCATION:Downsview\, Main Floor Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ada9e609dbc2b002c906eb5
