SUMMARY:Social Seniors: What is Artificial Intelligence?
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261201T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261201T160000
UID:6ae3d2e0de685359098c8704@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Social seniors is an opportunity for seniors in the neighbourh
 ood to meet and enjoy various activities such as games\, crafts\, speak
 ers\, classes\, and TPL tips (how to make the most of your TPL library acc
 ount). Relax\, have fun\, and learn something new while connecting with yo
 ur neighbours. Light refreshments will be provided from 2 to 2:30 and the
  program is from 2:30 to 4. Board games such as chess and Scrabble are alw
 ays available.
