 No experience\, no equipment\, no pressure. Come ready for honest conversa
 tions\, journaling\, and hands-on activities that give you real tools for 
 everyday life.\nHosted by the Villij\, a Toronto-based wellness company ro
 oted in mindful movement and community connection. Drop in. No registratio
 n required.\nThis workshop is part of the Teen Social Health and Wellness 
 programming. Generously supported by The Estate of Claudia Krawchuk.\nThis
  program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place fo
 r teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always av
 ailable. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch wi
 th a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
