SUMMARY:Romance Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261202T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261202T193000
UID:6ae3465c9dbc2b002c91dc9e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the Romance Book Club\, where love stories take cen
 tre stage and every page promises a new adventure of the heart. Whether yo
 u're into slow burns\, second chances\, or enemies-to-lovers\, there's som
 ething here for every kind of romantic. Come read\, swoon\, and share your
  favourite moments with fellow book lovers.\nThe Romance Book for the Dece
 mber 2nd meeting is\nKiss Her Once for Me\nby Alison Cochrun.\nLimited co
 pies will be available in branch for pick up from November 4th.\nPlease no
 te that this book club is for individuals 18+.\nDrop-ins welcome\, registr
 ation is optional but encouraged if you wish to receive a reminder email.\
 nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is 
 collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, s
 ections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for e
 vent and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about h
 ow the library handles your information can be directed to Answerline staf
 f at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M
 4W 2G8.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Second floor\, Room 1.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ae3465c9dbc2b002c91dc9e
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
