DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis session w
 ill highlight the $10\,000 York Science Scholars Award (YSSA)\, the $10\,0
 00 Helen Freedhoff First-Year Award for Physics applicants\, and the $25\,
 000 Yavin Family International Science Student Scholarship for internation
 al applicants.\nThe YSSA and Helen Freedhoff award consists of a $5\,000 e
 ntrance scholarship and a guaranteed $5\,000 paid summer research position
  after your first year of study. After the session\, hear from past award 
 winners about their experience. Bring your questions and discover how the 
 Faculty of Science entrance awards can support your journey at York!\n\n\n
 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nREGISTER HERE ( https://york
 u.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_eRUJGp-nRIOcrkZePIXgXA#/registration )\n\n 
 \nWe will be using Zoom to host this event. If you have any questions\, pl
 ease email science@yorku.ca ( mailto:science@yorku.ca )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
