 r teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always av
 ailable. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with
  a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.\nThe Mount Dennis Yout
 h Hub is for youth that are 13-17 years old in grades 8-12.
