 . DeMatteis & Joe Kelly and co-plotting by George Pérez & Devin Grayson (
 ebook available as well)\nDecember 7:\nDaredevil\n: Know Fear by Chip Zdar
 sky and Marco Checchetto (ebook available as well)\nParticipants are expec
 ted to pick up the respective books themselves.
