DESCRIPTION:Craft and socialize in a friendly and welcoming environment at
  our monthly adult and seniors crafternoon!\nConsider wearing clothes that
  you don't mind getting messy.\nOctober\n- Cork Pumpkin\nNovember\n- Holid
 ay Ornament\nDecember - Step-By-Step Acrylic Painting – Holiday Edition
 \nJoin us for a self-guided painting program. Create wintery artwork at y
 our own pace using printed instructions provided by library staff. All mat
 erials are supplied in this encouraging\, social\, and flexible environmen
 t of creative exploration.\nDrop in. Space is limited to 25 participants. 
  Arrive early to secure a spot!
LOCATION:Richview\, Room A\, 2nd Floor
