SUMMARY:AMPD Supplementary Evaluation Q&A Webinar (Portfolio-Based Applica
 tions)
DTSTART:20261218T000000Z
DTEND:20261218T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260918T185700Z
UID:MEC-33bd495470ddcf80911ca403ad6e3dd6@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261218T000000Z
SEQUENCE:19
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/
 09/suppeval.jpg
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp\; Design
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260918
DESCRIPTION:Join our virtual session to receive personalized support and g
 ain insights from our Recruitment Officer and current students about the s
 upplementary evaluation process for portfolio-based applications (Film Pro
 duction\, Screenwriting\, Visual Arts Studio & Design). We will discuss th
