DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261230T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261230T140000
UID:6ad8c120377296003a4d772b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy ridiculously fun multiplayer games with friends!\nRegist
 ration begins one month before program date. For ages 6 - 12.\nDrop-in's 
 welcome\, depending on program capacity.\nInformation Collection Notice:\n
 The personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public L
 ibrary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d)
 . The information will only be used for event and program registration\, d
 elivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your infor
 mation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-3
 97-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Malvern\, New Programming Space
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad8c120377296003a4d772b
