DESCRIPTION:Welcome the New Year with a burst of color and creativity! In 
 this exciting Adult+ program\, participants will paint a spectacular firew
 orks display inspired by the magic and celebration of\nNew Year 2027\n.\nT
 his creative activity is a wonderful opportunity to explore colors\, expre
 ss individuality\, and celebrate fresh starts. Participants will enjoy cre
 ating a bright and festive painting that captures the excitement\, joy\, a
 nd possibilities of a brand-new year.\nThis is a Drop-In program for Adult
 s and Seniors.\nNo registration required.\nSpace is limited. All materials
  are provided.
