DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270119T143000
UID:6a7259d3614a3e1aa9b6d7af@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join other book lovers in your community and participate in li
 vely discussions of popular books. This book club will meet every third Tu
 esday of the month for a lively discussion in a welcoming\, relaxed settin
 g. New members are always welcome and encouraged to join.\nNovember 17\, 2
 026 –\nRun Towards the Danger by Sarah Polley\nDecember 15\, 2026\n–\n
 Heart of the City by Robert Rotenberg\nJanuary 19\, 2027 –\nMy Friends 
 by Fredrik Backman\nFebruary 16\, 2027\n–\nThe Certainty Illusion by Tim
 othy Caulfield\nCopies of the book are available for borrowing at the Fair
 view Library.\nDrop-in\, no registration necessary.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7259d3614a3e1aa9b6d7af
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
