SUMMARY:After School Club-K'nex Fun
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270119T154500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270119T164500
UID:6adb855ba85a2c003381a3e5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages [\n6-12.]\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club 
 for participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generousl
 y supported\, in part\, by donors.\nJoin our weekly build-it challenge to 
 create your own masterpiece. Children will become junior engineers as they
  construct different projects using K'nex.\nWant to join last minute? Drop
 -ins are welcome if space is available!\nInformation Collection Notice:\nT
 he personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Li
 brary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d).
  The information will only be used for event and program registration\, de
 livery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your inform
 ation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-39
 7-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Steeles
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6adb855ba85a2c003381a3e5
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Older Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a56c066fb418a28009b035f"}
