SUMMARY:Coffee and Conversation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270120T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270120T150000
UID:6aca753c377296003a4b1824@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some light refreshments\, and informal discussion about 
 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization.\nIn January we will be joined by Ombudsman Toront
 o to discuss housing\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all partic
 ipants. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.
LOCATION:Spadina Road\, Centre of room at Canoe Table
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aca753c377296003a4b1824
