DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270126T170000
UID:6a9311651c197d11325bb340@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages 6-12.\nNow on Tuesdays\, 4-5 pm. Drop in\, until capacity.\
 nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for participants. Ingredi
 ent lists will be available. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, b
 y donors.
