CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260428T115721Z
DESCRIPTION:Open House evenings are opportunities for the public to come m
 eet\, get to know\, and join our community. We provide tours of the space\
 , limited use of the equipment (liability waiver required)\, and a great s
 ocial atmosphere. If you have a project you're working on\, feel encourag
 ed to bring it\, hang out\, and maybe get help with what you're working o
 n. Members are happy to answer questions as available. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811T195344Z
LOCATION:1677 St Clair Ave W\, Toronto\, ON M6N 1H9
STATUS:CONFIRMED
