DESCRIPTION:Join EarlyON for a weekly Music & Movement program designed fo
 r families with children from birth to 6 years. Enjoy interactive songs\, 
 stories\, finger rhymes\, movement\, and social time in a welcoming enviro
 nment.\nDrop-in\, no registration required.
LOCATION:Highland Creek\, Meeting Room
