 er)\, from 7:00pm - 9:00pm. Our meeting format is currently virtual and i
 s hosted on the Zoom platform.\n\nThe link for this month follows:\n\nJoi
 n Zoom Meeting (Link Updated)\n\n https://us02web.zoom.us/j/81552826953?p
