SUMMARY:Bucket List Spain w/ Running of the Bulls
DESCRIPTION:20s 30s Toronto Social & Activities\n**Enjoy Spain at its best
 ! Dine at the oldest restaurant in the world\, visit iconic museums such a
 s Prado and Guggenheim\, be amazed at Gaudi's architecture\, taste pinxtos
 \, sip good Spanish wine and view the Running of the Bulls from our own pr
 ivate balcony!**\n\nThis is just a little taste of what awaits us on this 
 awesome culinary and cultural adventure!\n\n*Spain is truly a magical and 
 fascinating country - full of history\, culture and oh . . . so much good 
 food and fun time!!!*\n*We get to travel as locals\, mostly by train betwe
 en the cities AND at the best time of year to be able to experience in per
 son The Running Of The Bulls in Pamplona.*\n\nWe visit:\n\n* Madrid\n* Bil
 bao\n* San Sebastian\n* Pamplona RUNNING OF THE BULLS\n* Barcelona\n\n*Gui
 ded tours in each city\, breakfast daily and several dinners\, museum entr
 ances\, tasting menus\, Running of the Bulls w/balcony view\, transportati
 on throughout the trip and much more!*\n\nWe travel as a group and have al
 l travel arrangements taken care of. The trip’s structure also gives you
  the free time and flexibility to cater to your own interests. We have inc
 luded sightseeing tours\, museum visits\, a-la-carte dinners\, our own bal
 cony to see the Running of the Bulls with the best and safest possible vie
 w\, but you also have the independence to enjoy the beautiful cities at yo
 ur own pace. The idea is simple: come alone\, meet like-minded people\, sh
 are unforgettable moments\, and create lasting friendships—all without t
 he rigid structure of a “one size fits all” tour.\n\n[CLICK HERE](http
 s://photos.app.goo.gl/F6Cyqavg7D9udncF9) to see photos from our previous S
 pain adventures!\n\n**Price per person\, double occupancy: US$5100**\n(We 
 match roommates for those who wish to share and save)\n**Price for single 
 room: US$6950**\n\nRSVP to the event to receive the day-by-day itinerary\,
  but if you want to secure your spot\, submit the **US$500 deposit here:**
 \n**[Click Here for Secure Deposit Link](https://www.paypal.com/instantcom
 merce/checkout/ULNGV9DYDGECC)**\n\nDeposit is refundable up to 90 days bef
 ore the departure (less PayPal fees).\n\n**[Click Here and Fill out this F
 orm if you are making a Deposit](https://forms.gle/XMbepMFnBbGwYS468)**\n\
 n*\\*\\*What’s Included\\*\\**\n• 12 nights in first-class hotels in c
 entral locations\n• Daily breakfast\n• Welcome dinner at Casa Botín i
 n Madrid (est. 1725)\, recognized by the Guinness Book of Records as the o
 ldest restaurant in the world\n• Authentic Basque foodie (pintxos) tour 
 in Bilbao\n• Transportation between all cities throughout the itinerary\
 n• Arrival and departure transfers (airport\, hotels\, and train station
 s)\n• City sightseeing tours in Madrid and Barcelona\n• Entrance ticke
 ts and guided visits to major highlights\, including the Prado Museum\, Gu
 ggenheim Museum\, and Sagrada Familia\n• Hands-on paella cooking class w
 ith sangria in Madrid\n• Private balcony access for a front-row (and saf
 e) viewing of the Running of the Bulls in Pamplona\n• Services of your t
 our leaders throughout the trip\n\nIn addition to the services listed abov
 e\, what’s truly included is a thoughtfully designed experience with gre
 at value\, smooth logistics\, a fun group atmosphere\, and the opportunity
  to create lasting friendships and unforgettable memories.\n\n*\\*\\*Not I
 ncluded\\*\\**\nx International airfare (we are happy to assist with arran
 gements)\nx Meals not specifically listed\nx Tips\, personal expenses\, an
 d incidental costs\n\n***[Click Here to fill out our google info request f
 orm](https://forms.gle/cQdqYw74gAYqphXX8)*** and receive detailed itinerar
 y and inclusions.\n\nLimited capacity of 24 total. This trip is cross-post
 ed on several Meetup groups and will fill up extremely quickly.\nWe have d
 esigned it to include all the "must see" locations.\n\n***[Click Here to M
 essage Direct to Anna with any questions.](https://secure.meetup.com/messa
 ges/?new_convo=true&member_id=131297062)***\nShe can help you arrange the 
 airfare and answer any logistics questions.\n\n[Click Here to see all our 
 other fun events](https://www.meetup.com/CulturalArts/Events)\n\nSOT 20003
 18-10
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/20s-30s-toronto-social-activities/eve
 nts/316912440/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261009T170602Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261009T170602Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
